      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 1,
      "characterName": "fencer",
      "text": [
        "I did not mean to disturb you. Apologies, Prince.",
        "You and I are next."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [2, 3],
      "decision": true,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 2,
      "characterName": "prince",
      "text": [
        "What the, a note? Ah... Well alright I suppose. I understand wanting to meet royalty."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [4],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 3,
      "characterName": "prince",
      "text": [
        "What the, a note? I’m aware... Is that all?"
      ],
      "targetIndex": [5],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 4,
      "characterName": "fencer",
      "text": [
        "I would not expect our prince to venture into these treacherous lands, does the public know?",
        "You seem to have made yourself at home down here."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [6, 7],
      "decision": true,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 5,
      "characterName": "fencer",
      "text": [
        "You seem tense, is something wrong?",
        "I just wanted to see what I'm up against."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [8, 9],
      "decision": true,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 0],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 6,
      "characterName": "prince",
      "text": [
        "Who else is fit to slay the Devil and rid the world of darkness? It is my birth right."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [10],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 7,
      "characterName": "prince",
      "text": [
        "Simply trying to maintain a clear mind. Big things ahead. Anyway is that all? I am in the midst of reading."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [10],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 8,
      "characterName": "prince",
      "text": [
        "You think I, tense? You carry humour better than a sword. You’ll find no nerves here."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [11],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 9,
      "characterName": "prince",
      "text": [
        "Well, you’ll see standing before you a man and a hero."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [12],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 10,
      "characterName": "fencer",
      "text": [
        "Your sword is rather unconventional for a fencing tournament, looks heavy.",
        "I will leave you be. Good luck out there."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [13, 14],
      "decision": true,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, 1],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 11,
      "characterName": "fencer",
      "text": [
        "Apologies for the assumption.",
        "You lie worse than you fence."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [15, 16],
      "decision": true,
      "relationshipPoints": [1, -1],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 12,
      "characterName": "fencer",
      "text": [
        "You are a very confident man.",
        "You don't have to worry, my skills with the sword are more than enough for you."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [17, 18],
      "decision": true,
      "relationshipPoints": [0, -1],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": false
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 13,
      "characterName": "prince",
      "text": [
        "It is, both literally and figuratively. Regardless, Fencer, I am occupied. Leave now."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": true
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 14,
      "characterName": "prince",
      "text": [
        "Ah well, thank you but I make my own luck. Run along now."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": true
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 15,
      "characterName": "prince",
      "text": [
        "Assumptions get people hurt. Bad practice, Fencer. Leave now."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": true
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 16,
      "characterName": "prince",
      "text": [
        "How dare you!? You are a vile man who I will take great pleasure in defeating."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": true
    },

    {
      "currIndex": 17,
      "characterName": "prince",
      "text": [
        "I have to be, my people count on me. Now leave."
      ],
      "targetIndex": [null],
      "decision": false,
      "relationshipPoints": [0],
      "pointRequirement": -1,
      "endDialogueEarly": true
    },

    {
